{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着人工智能工具在職場中的普及，越來越多企業開始鼓勵甚至要求員工使用AI輔助工作。不過，美國近日出現的一起案例顯示，即便不信奉任何神靈，員工仍有可能基於自身信念獲得免於使用AI的宗教性豁免。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584430.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:04:51.632111+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:51:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:17.444239+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:17.444239+00:00","content_hash":"de092c83a2d4b22485356393ce63e680837259425977a8ae6a7019819b325285","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}